    {
      "id": "Jq40aEHWta_z4iWicaLAc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3440.81043179533,
      "y": 8711.795719243877,
      "width": 1144.0169438310704,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1105424721,
      "version": 839,
      "versionNonce": 58627879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749697823977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 通用深度研究与自定义模板驱动：DeepResearch框架（DeerFlow字节开源框架/gemini-fullstack-langgraph-quickstart/II-Agent）、信息可信度管理、以及\n模板驱动的内容生成范式；\n2. 知识库开发与调优平台：库帕斯\n3. 深度知识应用：音频概览与播客式解读、思维导图生成、自动化会议摘要、灵感生成器、员工知识智能管理。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 通用深度研究与自定义模板驱动：DeepResearch框架（DeerFlow字节开源框架/gemini-fullstack-langgraph-quickstart/II-Agent）、信息可信度管理、以及模板驱动的内容生成范式；\n2. 知识库开发与调优平台：库帕斯\n3. 深度知识应用：音频概览与播客式解读、思维导图生成、自动化会议摘要、灵感生成器、员工知识智能管理。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_IXtBlz9YTHR5pGGWOaWZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4317.112915291186,
      "y": 8525.273621263106,
      "width": 562.9918823242188,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1265090879,
      "version": 505,
      "versionNonce": 2101892273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749628159222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PDF解析工具汇总：\n1. Marker：PDF转Markdown，支持公式、图片嵌入，对于表格转换识别率低；\n2. MinerU：PDF转Markdown，多模态解析，依赖CUDA，性能较好；\n3. Docling：解析PDF/DOCX/PPTX等，适用于企业合同解析，依赖CUDA；\n4. Llamaparse： 收费，解析精度高，速度慢，图谱生成；\n5. Dolphin：字节开源，多模态文档解析，Json或MD格式。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PDF解析工具汇总：\n1. Marker：PDF转Markdown，支持公式、图片嵌入，对于表格转换识别率低；\n2. MinerU：PDF转Markdown，多模态解析，依赖CUDA，性能较好；\n3. Docling：解析PDF/DOCX/PPTX等，适用于企业合同解析，依赖CUDA；\n4. Llamaparse： 收费，解析精度高，速度慢，图谱生成；\n5. Dolphin：字节开源，多模态文档解析，Json或MD格式。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wb8DQWT4Bum9sLXFs12qp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4314.227914167517,
      "y": 8678.756613426014,
      "width": 720.49560546875,
      "height": 60,
