      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749628532674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "多模态解析与对齐：\n1. CLIP：Hugging Face，多模态向量化，对应开源项目：MultimodalRAG，用clip、faiss和智谱AI；\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "多模态解析与对齐：\n1. CLIP：Hugging Face，多模态向量化，对应开源项目：MultimodalRAG，用clip、faiss和智谱AI；\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
