      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1749880868361,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "主要特征：\n1. 微循环 + 主循环\n2. 由用户提问驱动\n3. 多轮人机交互\n4. 执行节点显式定义Workflow\n\n典型应用：\nToC：Genspark、Skywork...\nToB：智谱CoCo....\nToD：Dify、N8N、Coze、\n        Relevance AI.....",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "主要特征：\n1. 微循环 + 主循环\n2. 由用户提问驱动\n3. 多轮人机交互\n4. 执行节点显式定义Workflow\n\n典型应用：\nToC：Genspark、Skywork...\nToB：智谱CoCo....\nToD：Dify、N8N、Coze、\n        Relevance AI.....",
