      "updated": 1752496153132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. 形成结论与战略建议\n3.1 主要结论\n3.2 基于数据的政策建议\n4. 报告终审与交付",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 形成结论与战略建议\n3.1 主要结论\n3.2 基于数据的政策建议\n4. 报告终审与交付",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "H7OA9eHm0xHRmxS8Y0k8_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1199.9310715205793,
      "y": 10197.726983644838,
