      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752496481458,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.1. 明确核算边界与方法：范围一二",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.1. 明确核算边界与方法：范围一二",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q9gt44eoKuf46Zx6rfQh1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1198.412122991099,
      "y": 10221.876504600114,
      "width": 251.14710372427407,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bS4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 601037626,
      "version": 124,
      "versionNonce": 575295866,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752496410885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "严格遵循地域原则，核算徐汇区行\n政边界内发生的所有直接排放（范\n围一）和电力热力调入的间接排放\n（范围二）。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "严格遵循地域原则，核算徐汇区行政边界内发生的所有直接排放（范围一）和电力热力调入的间接排放（范围二）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dBszIDdiFaeHAT2vI8RUw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1195.1804155435952,
      "y": 10304.157430245357,
      "width": 238.60124364472082,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bS5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 183160166,
      "version": 260,
      "versionNonce": 802722918,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752496501243,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "范围一包含：化石燃料燃烧排\n放、工业生产过程排放‌、‌废弃物\n处理排放、‌其他直接源项‌，范围\n二包含：外购电力使用排放、‌外\n购热力/冷气使用排放‌。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "范围一包含：化石燃料燃烧排放、工业生产过程排放‌、‌废弃物处理排放、‌其他直接源项‌，范围二包含：外购电力使用排放、‌外购热力/冷气使用排放‌。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
